i-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Glass half most.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1c/Glass_half_most..png/revision/latest?cb=20250609092900\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Glass half most.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1c/Glass_half_most..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250609092900\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1c/Glass_half_most..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250609092900 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1c/Glass_half_most..png/revision/latest?cb=20250609092900 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Glass half most.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Glass_half_most..png\" data-image-name=\"Glass half most..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">19</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/It%27s_got_to_be_obsolete.\" title=\"It&#39;s got to be obsolete.\">It's got to be obsolete.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Science_all_your_life.\" title=\"Science all your life.\">Science all your life.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Glass half most.</b></i> is the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">Series 19</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 12 June 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Glass_half_most.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a> says \"Glass half most\" whilst choosing between writing the word 'most' or 'least' during the <a href=\"/wiki/Eat_this_yoghurt_with_the_most/least_dignity\" title=\"Eat this yoghurt with the most/least dignity\">Eat this yoghurt with the most/least dignity</a> task, presumably trying to convey that she’s making her choice because she’s an optimist. The title card shows a small tiny wooden block floating in a container of water, referencing both the <a href=\"/wiki/What_is_in_the_one_yellow_box%3F\" title=\"What is in the one yellow box?\">What is in the one yellow box?</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Put_at_least_six_litres_of_water_in_the_vase\" title=\"Put at least six litres of water in the vase\">Put at least six litres of water in the vase</a> tasks.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Glass_half_most.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>Our five fabulous comics continue their quest to impress the omniscient, omnipotent and omnibrilliant Taskmaster. <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a> tries to befriend a fisherman, <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a> displays a talent for trotting, <a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</a> boasts about her seductive scent, <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a> pitches for a role in Downton Abbey and <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a> spectacularly forfeits any remaining dignity. In a not-unrelated instance, Little <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a>'s shoes are doused with yoghurt.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/19/7/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jason Mantzoukas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mathew Baynton</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Ramsey</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Stevie Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Biggest_anticlimax\" title=\"Biggest anticlimax\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Biggest anticlimax.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/What_is_in_the_one_yellow_box%3F\" title=\"What is in the one yellow box?\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>What is in the one yellow box? You may only give one answer. All the information is in the task.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eat_this_yoghurt_with_the_most/least_dignity\" title=\"Eat this yoghurt with the most/least dignity\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Eat this yoghurt with the most/least dignity.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_at_least_six_litres_of_water_in_the_vase\" title=\"Put at least six litres of water in the vase\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put at least six litres of water in the vase. You must either use bucket A and route A or bucket B and route B. If you choose A, you must complete one of the tasks at every obstacle. If you choose B, you must trot throughout. You must stay within the arena at all times and must never touch the vase.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_one_of_your_balls_into_your_bucket\" title=\"Get one of your balls into your bucket\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Get one of your balls into your bucket.  Your spoons must be poking through the fence when touching the ball, and only your spoons may touch your ball. You may not touch the other team's balls or buckets or spoons. You must always be on your side of the fence and your balls must always be on the other. If your ball touches the ground, you must start again.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">23\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Glass_half_most.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/\"><i>Glass half most.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141533\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.108 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.153 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 998/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26989/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 743/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800089/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTr